               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N202DF">33 x 25.7</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E2">1 single folio. Written in brown ink. Paper: 20 staves. On the first page, staves 1-16 comprises a version for one or two voices, notated on one stave with text of all five stanzas beneath. Above the music: "Soldatervise / Kan synges af 1 eller 3 Stemmer" (To be sung by 1 or 3 voices). On staves 17-20 and verso staves 1-6, a version for piano solo. At the end of the music signed and dated: "I:P:E:Hartmann / d. 30 Marts 48." Beneath the music: "Udsat for Orchester til Theatret d. 5 April / do for Militairet <rend xml:id="idm34" rend="underline">do</rend> og til Garden til Fods d. 12 April".</physMedium>
